  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a37c10aaba331fcf",
      "translationZh": "介绍 Gemini 3.5 Flash 中的计算机使用功能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b05e810a29ca8f6",
      "translationZh": "计算机使用现已成为 Gemini 3.5 Flash 的内置工具，可用于构建能够跨平台交互的智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52ce2e9a444c7ed5",
      "translationZh": "Google DeepMind 产品经理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "你的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9396d34c840bf012",
      "translationZh": "此内容由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b78556ee59d8c78c",
      "translationZh": "计算机使用现已成为 Gemini 3.5 Flash 支持的内置工具，在智能体计算机使用任务上实现了我们迄今为止的最佳表现。此前，计算机使用功能仅通过独立的 Gemini 2.5 计算机使用模型提供，如今已原生集成到主力 Gemini Flash 模型中。Gemini 已经在函数调用以及使用 Search 和 Maps 信息锚定等内置工具方面表现出色。有了内置的计算机使用能力，开发者现在可以使用 3.5 Flash 可靠地构建自定义智能体，让它们能够在浏览器、移动端和桌面环境中观察、推理并采取行动。这提升了长周期任务和企业自动化任务的表现，例如持续软件测试，以及跨专业应用开展的知识工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "87c5c8d97580ddc7",
      "translationZh": "开发者和企业可以通过 Gemini API 和 Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform 开始使用 3.5 Flash 中的计算机使用功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "314bf4c7cdd38820",
      "translationZh": "3.5 Flash 使用计算机使用功能来分析 Gemini 应用，并返回按类别整理的功能列表。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6734bef893352771",
      "translationZh": "具备计算机使用能力的 3.5 Flash 审核自身文档中的无障碍问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "440ae01bcd26aa31",
      "translationZh": "确保 3.5 Flash 中计算机使用的安全性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf05d49a520e5519",
      "translationZh": "为缓解在真实环境中运行的智能体面临的部分提示注入风险，我们针对 Gemini 3.5 Flash 的计算机使用能力开展了有针对性的对抗训练。我们还推出了两套可选的企业安全防护系统，使企业能够：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3ec9d2525a8a81b9",
      "translationZh": "要求用户对敏感或不可逆的操作进行明确确认。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "110ed281676f02e8",
      "translationZh": "在检测到间接提示注入时自动停止任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f67f13bcc7d793d",
      "translationZh": "我们采用“纵深防御”方法，鼓励开发者将这些功能与安全沙箱隔离、人工参与验证及严格的访问控制结合使用。有关安全措施的更多信息，请参阅我们的最佳实践文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3767a64020d126ef",
      "translationZh": "我们已经看到客户通过计算机使用能力创造价值。以下是其中一些客户的评价：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef2b7db5808e39d4",
      "translationZh": "如需立即开始利用计算机使用能力进行开发：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "872e3035d875df51",
      "translationZh": "立即试用：在 Browserbase 托管的演示环境中测试这些能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "87a9555a09867e4b",
      "translationZh": "开始构建：通过 Gemini API 和 Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform 深入了解我们的参考实现和文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ba07e0e30582b629",
      "translationZh": "在收件箱中接收 Google 的最新消息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1c2f6429af68386",
      "translationZh": "已完成。只差最后一步。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "177af4ad1775d8ae",
      "translationZh": "请查看收件箱，确认你的订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ff091e7a47df15e",
      "translationZh": "你也可以使用一个来订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fefef2f9c6cb957b",
      "translationZh": "我们在 2026 年 9 月公布的最新 AI 消息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "81c0514443d15d43",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 4 Argon：我们前沿智能的下一个时代",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1dcfa6e64bf1becb",
      "translationZh": "看看 4 位开发者正在用 Gemini 3.8 Flash 打造什么",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "39afd3b78512f5a1",
      "translationZh": "推出配备 Live Avatar 的 Gemini 3.8 Live",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c6c3ba8ca3a0a1e",
      "translationZh": "作者：Shuo-yiin Chang 与 CJ Zheng",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "70d482221fed8fb8",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.8 文本转语音向你问好",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c469504563ec2671",
      "translationZh": "作者：Leland Rechis 与 Alan Cowen",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2cf3496069245fb0",
      "translationZh": "推出 Gemini 3.8 Live 和 3.8 Live Extended Thinking",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
